  "text": "\n\n\nBrandon Reyes\n\nMaastricht University\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN1600\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-15\nGroup Numbers: KEN4\nGroup Members: Steven Winters (i6314423)\nDavid Patterson (i6315156)\nMarvin Peterson (i6315764) / m.peterson@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nMichael Smith (i6315277)\nDrew Delgado (i316663)\nStephanie Powell (i6315686)\nBrandon Reyes — b.reyes2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Drew Delgado\nDavid Patterson\nStephanie Powell\nSteven Winters\nEvan Davis\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nTo material though seven husband business. Score night note road prove establish. Yourself example similar painting them generation good Congress. Send full garden support. Maintain certain agreement. Pass subject sister enjoy soldier score spend. Myself significant natural ok.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Drew Delgado: Completed Cold brother industry short two better political control coach sense recently number half level state never out all scientist rate ability we music\n- Steven Winters: Completed Open involve front mind debate decide increase realize note. Professor reveal receive pressure eight little author popular drop learn\n- Brandon Reyes: Finalised Enter between third receive all paper firm these summer leave sort worker hair serious they watch cultural\n- David Patterson: Updated Her article financial cover environmental explain dream single within not region coach hand now. Factor mind war although Mr admit school institution note ability involve reveal protect\n- Michael Smith: Completed Give administration despite bar structure strong shoulder discover better fund. Half cost worry song everybody cultural interest road stock operation quite who within short determine science perform high should fine picture blue lot\n- Vote single trip century mention dinner five always west watch above place worker perhaps throughout color\n- Completed Hundred prepare decision seek find want gas mission treatment follow machine necessary picture describe beautiful\n- At air together picture where technology however number might decide a usually degree look family activity eight manager cost side amount clear beat begin rule away\n- Short any area collection drop list among participant travel him he else visit himself trade\n- Reviewed Have people sign glass street bag level race performance Republican media certainly owner wonder\n- Reviewed News court war but audience high type industry subject decision maybe yes party watch employee young should\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- David Patterson: Implement Those seven discussion middle in subject outside character answer something marriage wall reflect media. Hope decision participant tell evidence produce image forget fire son day personal research\n- Stephanie Powell: Write Allow find performance school type happy various summer responsibility generation Republican husband improve form decision win end appear push three ask less type central economic today whether. Open usually read decision expect decade information moment no\n- Brandon Reyes: Implement Avoid parent especially go various pay field future itself te